  "authors": [],
  "body": {
    "comment": "Yoroi DRep votes YES on Withdraw 540,750 ada for UTxO RPC by TxPipe: Maintaining Cardano's Integration Layer. The Cardano community has spoken clearly through the Hydra off-chain voting platform, and Yoroi is committed to honouring that voice.\n\n- Honouring the Community Mandate: With a supermajority of over 67% in the off-chain governance process, this proposal carries a strong and unambiguous signal of community support. Yoroi votes Yes in alignment with that collective decision."
  },
  "hashAlgorithm": "blake2b-256"
}